#: ../../../../../../docs/development/dependencies.md:8
msgid "维护依赖来源与精确选版"
msgstr "Maintain dependency provenance and exact selection"

#: ../../../../../../docs/development/dependencies.md:10
msgid ""
"外部 Git 源先由 X-Gen-Lab 托管，Nexus 以精确 gitlink 和锁选择版本。官方来源、 "
"实际获取地址、选中提交、许可与本地修改分别记录，不以版本名代替源码身份。"
msgstr ""
"X-Gen-Lab hosts external Git source; Nexus selects versions through exact "
"gitlinks and locks. Record the official upstream, actual fetch URL, selected"
" commit, licenses and local changes separately. A version name does not "
"replace source identity."

#: ../../../../../../docs/development/dependencies.md:13
msgid "按实际任务准备"
msgstr "Prepare the actual task"

#: ../../../../../../docs/development/dependencies.md:15
msgid ""
"`tools/maintenance/source_catalogue.py` 维护来源与已审供应方映射，package 声明 其硬件依赖，TOML "
"选择后端与组件。CMake 仍拥有实际翻译单元和链接图，不增加另一 份源码清单。未选 vendor 库存保留，但不进入默认准备、构建或 SDK 输出。"
msgstr ""
"`tools/maintenance/source_catalogue.py` maintains provenance and reviewed "
"supplier mappings. Packages declare hardware dependencies, and TOML selects "
"backends and components. CMake continues to own actual translation units and"
" the link graph; do not add another source manifest. Unselected vendor "
"inventory is retained but excluded from default preparation, builds and SDK "
"output."

#: ../../../../../../docs/development/dependencies.md:24
msgid ""
"已有外部应用可按其 TOML 运行 `prepare --scope assembly --assembly <path>`；Native 明确加 "
"`--test-support`。`--scope native` 则仍表示平台维护的完整宿主测试图，包含 "
"GoogleTest／GoogleMock和维护测试实际使用的运行依赖。"
msgstr ""
"For an existing external application, run `prepare --scope assembly "
"--assembly <path>` against its TOML; Native explicitly adds `--test-"
"support`. `--scope native` still denotes the complete maintained host-test "
"graph, including GoogleTest/GoogleMock and runtime dependencies actually "
"used by maintenance tests."

#: ../../../../../../docs/development/dependencies.md:28
msgid ""
"准备器默认离线核对来源、真实 gitlink、HEAD、工作区、递归子模块与别名身份。 仅显式 `--allow-network` "
"才允许获取选中闭包，不静默改 origin 或选择更新版本。 源码消费和发布使用同一锁；安装 SDK 通过自己的完整 manifest 校验原字节。"
msgstr ""
"By default, preparation verifies provenance, real gitlinks, HEADs, "
"worktrees, recursive submodules and alias identities offline. Only explicit "
"`--allow-network` permits fetching the selected closure; it does not "
"silently change origins or select newer versions. Source consumption and "
"publication use the same lock. An installed SDK verifies original bytes "
"through its own complete manifest."

#: ../../../../../../docs/development/dependencies.md:32
msgid "更新依赖"
msgstr "Update dependencies"

#: ../../../../../../docs/development/dependencies.md:34
msgid "固定上游变更及许可证，选择组织托管的精确提交，并核对保留引用与获取方式。"
msgstr ""
"Pin the upstream changes and license identity, select an exact organization-"
"hosted commit, and check retained references and fetch mechanisms."

#: ../../../../../../docs/development/dependencies.md:35
msgid "明确本地补丁、递归来源、alias 和所选平台／后端／组件受影响范围。"
msgstr ""
"Identify local patches, recursive sources, aliases and the affected "
"platform/backend/component scope."

#: ../../../../../../docs/development/dependencies.md:36
msgid "更新实际 gitlink 与匹配锁，执行最小失败回归和真实构建上下文。"
msgstr ""
"Update actual gitlinks and matching locks, execute the minimal failing "
"regression, and use the real build context."

#: ../../../../../../docs/development/dependencies.md:37
msgid "对受影响的 Native、ARM 与独立 SDK 消费执行相应门禁，保留原失败和源码身份。"
msgstr ""
"Run the appropriate gates for affected Native, ARM and independent SDK "
"consumers; retain original failures and source identity."

#: ../../../../../../docs/development/dependencies.md:38
msgid "普通提交与评审通过后合并；既有标签与旧产物保持原始身份。"
msgstr ""
"Merge after normal commit checks and review. Existing tags and old artifacts"
" retain their original identities."

#: ../../../../../../docs/development/dependencies.md:40
msgid ""
"嵌套来源使用所属父提交的真实 `.gitmodules` 与 gitlink。不能用路径、子模块名、 组织 fork URL 或上游同名 tag "
"互相替代。未经验证的目录、脏源码与缺失许可证必须 拒绝；依赖变更不自动扩大 MCU、模式或物理支持。"
msgstr ""
"Nested sources use the actual `.gitmodules` and gitlinks of their owning "
"parent commit. Paths, submodule names, organization-fork URLs and equally "
"named upstream tags are not interchangeable. Unverified directories, dirty "
"source and missing licenses must be rejected. A dependency change does not "
"automatically expand MCU, mode or physical support."

#: ../../../../../../docs/development/dependencies.md:44
msgid ""
"Native 最小消费与完整维护图是不同选择，维护范围不会因教程优化而削弱。 工具准备缓存可复用，历史成功报告不作为新源码验收。发布范围见 [SDK "
"发布](sdk-publishing.md)，代码接口／schema 代际见 [SDK "
"格式合同](../reference/contracts/sdk-format.md)。"
msgstr ""
"Minimal Native consumption and the complete maintenance graph are separate "
"selections. Tutorial improvements do not weaken maintenance scope. Tool-"
"preparation caches may be reused; historical success reports do not qualify "
"new source. See [SDK publication](sdk-publishing.md) for release scope and "
"the [SDK format contract](../reference/contracts/sdk-format.md) for source-"
"interface/schema epochs."
